      </span>
      <span style="display:inline-grid;place-items:center;flex:none;width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:50%;border:2.5px solid var(--ink);background:#d9e4ff;box-shadow:0 3px 0 var(--ink);overflow:hidden">
       <img src="/icons/av-cat.png" alt="Cat" draggable="false" style="width:84%;height:84%;object-fit:contain;pointer-events:none"/>
